# Mutation plan for crates/mm-markdown (the shared/markdown port).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/markdown.plan
#
# Every line is a decision a reader of the Go source could plausibly get wrong; the suite is the
# 558-row Go oracle in fixtures/behaviour_markdown.json. The last two lines are the no-op
# controls and must SURVIVE.

